%N A401234 Squarefree numbers k such that A006530(k) divides A276085(k), where A006530(k) is the largest prime dividing k (with 1 if k is 1), and A276085 is fully additive with a(p) = p#/p.
%H A401234 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A401234/b401234.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..3142</a>
